{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2022-06-17 14:00:00', 'title': 'BOEING REAFFIRMS COMMITMENT TO HBCUS WITH $8 MILLION INVESTMENT THROUGH THURGOOD MARSHALL COLLEGE FUND', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA., JUNE 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, BOEING (NYSE: BA) AND THE THURGOOD MARSHALL COLLEGE FUND (TMCF) ANNOUNCED A NEW $8 MILLION, MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP TO SUPPORT THE DEVELOPMENT OF FUTURE TECHNICAL TALENT.'}